    <guid isPermaLink="false">66730d69b6a8412729f74cce</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！这期节目是一期串台节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsSTQaWBbuvoiM2Z-33-LuXEDoje.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>有幸收到了《嗨聊对话框》的邀请一起来聊聊省钱，以前上网总是直接买买买，现在商家套路真是深深深！但是别慌，本期播客专治套路！不是大风刮来的钱，多一分咱也不能让商家挣喽！</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自90后的“抠搜”大总结，应对经济下行，重点是我们花更少的钱，获得同样的品质！快来听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmLHBHX4cTJu0s9bof0JLkv2hF83.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> </span><strong><span>你们是抠搜的人吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> 凑满减、拼一件。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 耗时半小时，省了一百块。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 拼单薅羊毛！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 为了领一百块花了六百块！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 囤货。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 付费订阅就是个大坑！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> iCloud居然能退钱？但是不推荐！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 办卡需谨慎！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 闲鱼是个好东西。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜荔枝｜网易云｜苹果播客｜QQ音乐｜微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
