  <item>
    <title>童年你都玩些啥｜Vol.16</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6627d061200abebe6ecea543</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6627d061200abebe6ecea543</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第十六期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候觉得每一天都很长，在那些充满故事划痕的课桌上、追逐打闹活力满满的操场上、背着超大书包欢声笑语的放学的路上能做的事情有很多。现在的我们时常调侃光阴易逝，又总学不会珍惜。课业繁重，儿时的初心也逐渐变得模糊。本期节目的内容是追溯那些在旧时光里和朋友一起玩过的经典游戏，现在开始与时间赛跑，我们带你一起回到童年，把玩幼稚的游戏、感受童年的快乐。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6_mt7XiMJ5AQNnNs15Iz46Do9Y.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5RbaC5XH621OTvCOtt6x9sRZsd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> </span><strong><span>童年必玩的泥巴。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 别人堆雪人，我直接整个雪堡。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 你们那捉迷藏都叫什么名字。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 滚铁圈。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 男孩的童年少不了玩具枪。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> &nbsp;遥控直升机、四驱车、悠悠球。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> 从小就抽奖、刮彩票。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 小学同学带笔记本来班里玩游戏。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 抓兔子、摸鱼、玩火都是少不了的项目。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>正观音 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝｜QQ音乐｜微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
