  <item>
    <title>流浪猫在车轮经过后挣扎，而我亲眼目睹这一切！！！｜嗨嗨Yi月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660d7d74c891c06e732e72be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660d7d74c891c06e732e72be</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第十四期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《嗨嗨Yi月》是我们的新栏目！每月会更新一期，和大家分享一下这个月当中发生的事情。无论是生活中的小插曲、大事件还是什么意想不到的事等等……我们都会放在《嗨嗨Yi月》中来聊一聊。让我们一起嗨嗨一乐，笑对生活的每一个瞬间！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsALMj0yvfniQIbAKlrxfqSi-j3J.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgV8y58tBfziCY2S9vL0s_RIvaD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> </span><strong><span>忙里偷闲，参加一个小分享会。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fox9UBZc421PLXRoC84WxgfVrqwt.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（回答问题就能收到小礼品）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 最大的收获居然是小礼品。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 净水器我可是狠狠研究了一番。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 春天不得买几盆花？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMfzeoeT1NWiDO_rekSjl3im0JP.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（九子哥的阳台）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> 九子哥偷偷养猫。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrH28dyz5ICiyp3ZFlxi0irYPGqo.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（猫咪太可爱了，狠狠亲一口。）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 小区里的流浪猫被车轧了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 最终我还是决定下楼帮小猫收尸。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loflJ4sT1UN6kWL_A7thPjVux3C7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（九子哥埋葬了小猫）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 报个课也能被骗，又去派出所了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> 同样的伞，我已经丢了6把了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a> 没有咖啡机，但我有咖啡豆。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 没有vip只能听60秒。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 给家里铺上了地毯。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 正观音剪了短发。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvPeMkSF2NK-tPykionDh6rEXHM-.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a> 人生可不能撤回。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">44:33</a> 出差去日本，居然还遇到地震。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llT8MBp4eGiiZY-wacZyGa6xjp2U.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（迷失东京）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a> 日本真是太好逛了。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgx0aT9VwE2MMHZpyevOrO7ITrTz.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（翻相册感觉自己是个代购）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">54:24</a> 广州之旅可太不顺了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>易玖 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝｜QQ音乐｜微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
