  <item>
    <title>这里是新疆：能说话就会唱歌，能走路就会跳舞！｜Vol.13</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660590891519139e4f385643</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660590891519139e4f385643</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukGU3KNf3KcKXtKewdIJumGKJQi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第十三期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌏</span><strong><span>列车长有话说</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本次列车从黑吉辽出发，历经江浙沪、新一线、港澳台和北上广（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fbfc231519139e4fbc29aa" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fbfc231519139e4fbc29aa"><span>特别篇丨北上广很卷，我们爱恨都不浅？</span></a><span>），即将抵达本次列车的终点站——大西北。本期节目将由三位主播带领大家去寻访位于大西北的美丽而遥远的新疆，千百年来，它以迷人的风光、多样的生活方式被传播，是无数人梦寐想望的地方；三位主播将从各自的视角为大家讲述一个客观、真实的新疆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnrvpxsn-pOfQmMXWcwcjABe5Qb3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>胡阿姨</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb"><span>《JINGYI RADIO》</span></a><span>主播，不土生但土长的新疆江苏人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>易 玖</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb"><span>《JINGYI RADIO》</span></a><span>主播，不土生但土长的新疆重庆人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>蓝朋友</span></strong><span>： </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236"><span>《 共 商 闲 举 》</span></a><span> 主播，既不土生也不土长的新疆福建人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌏</span><strong><span>本次列车导航</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> </span><strong><span>带都市乌鲁木齐。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liMk1L4P3f8LPZiCbC0uIoflj3mX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（黄昏时的乌鲁木齐）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> </span><strong><span>守望相助，全方位援建新疆。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FirErCOQtA0RckOEOsXl22EGlDQX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（蓝朋友到乌鲁木齐时的日出）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a></span><strong><span> 这都晚上九点了，你那怎么还亮着呢。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> </span><strong><span>到底是斤还是公斤？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> </span><strong><span>瓜果当饭吃。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmxdPqdnB72nUzqgdzOg-AM6KujF.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（新疆的水果是真的甜）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> </span><strong><span>凉快的夏天，流鼻血的冬天。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> </span><strong><span>交通不便大新疆。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> </span><strong><span>偏远地区不包邮。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> </span><strong><span>全疆居然只有一条地铁线。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> </span><strong><span>停靠在八楼的二路汽车，是留在乌鲁木齐难舍的情结！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> </span><strong><span>新疆人不得骑马上学。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkJ9P2y_oaJqYHkqauiXE1-Fkec2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（牧民的马们）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> </span><strong><span>新疆人能说话的就会唱歌，能走路的就会跳舞。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> </span><strong><span>最炫民族风的新疆广场舞。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgoHpU6CoScrhvmTNnoWnjfi_xjR.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（翻遍了相册，只有这张小型广场舞）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> </span><strong><span>维语方便面怎么说。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> </span><strong><span>究竟谁说了我爱你，还是维语的！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> </span><strong><span>新疆女生都像迪丽热巴、古力娜扎。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> </span><strong><span>南农业都是兵团，北畜牧都是少数民族？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> </span><strong><span>小白杨屯垦戍边精神。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> </span><strong><span>喀纳斯水怪。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a> </span><strong><span>早穿棉袄午穿纱，围着火炉吃西瓜。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> </span><strong><span>滑雪：新疆的雪好还是东北的雪好。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqp0Oywl7irYiXTwuKgwGYw5glBd.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（丝绸之路滑雪场的初级道之一）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> </span><strong><span>看雪吃雪新疆人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> </span><strong><span>少数民族的小花帽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> </span><strong><span>旅游出行温馨提示1：南疆人文景观、北疆自然风光</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnWpCJEHGt-70o9Mtzw_6qBY05d2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（南疆风光）</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljrI1FSFjqe-xPSafIwvllt2LZeV.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（北疆主打一个大自然）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> </span><strong><span>旅游出行温馨提示2：南疆直飞喀什、北疆直飞乌鲁木齐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> </span><strong><span>旅游出行温馨提示3：美食大多是碳水炸弹</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpDhR8tgtAWkxxUqNF6UhhvYHxyU.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（怎么都是肉，不是碳水吗？）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2813">46:53</a> </span><strong><span>对新疆的眷恋，再吃一顿抓饭！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmvCdIHGbRp3MB39j-cwXI1pGWQ5.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（咱就说，真的是香疯了）</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【城市，声声不息】串台计划将结束，请收起小桌板，调整座椅靠背，准备下车。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>🌏</span><strong><span>发起播客品牌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6"><span>《朋友走慢点》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652276ede08de9fda5a66cb0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/652276ede08de9fda5a66cb0"><span>《掰白百拜》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65596866af867a0d91acaad9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65596866af867a0d91acaad9"><span>《奇思妙谈》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dbfe39a8b6eb27b6082596" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61dbfe39a8b6eb27b6082596"><span>《杏子鸡尾酒》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/641e7eb25010d7c9f1942236"><span>《共商闲举》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65445e7488103669c58a6beb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65445e7488103669c58a6beb"><span>《心理共鸣》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63b53f37a7b161b6b921c84d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63b53f37a7b161b6b921c84d"><span>《漫游者说》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d8a3870bef6c20743f5dfb"><span>《JINGYI RADIO》</span></a><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/628b19c16c7eec4d0113c7eb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/628b19c16c7eec4d0113c7eb"><span>《脑力有限》</span></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>🌏</span><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝｜QQ音乐｜微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
