  <item>
    <title>上学，你凭实力，我靠选择！｜Vol.12</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f9d571676495707954bf8a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f9d571676495707954bf8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第十二期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容我们聊了和学习有关的故事。其实回想起来，重点已不是学习本身，而且和围绕它衍生出来的学习生活。虽然我们四位主播都是艺术生（美术），但是我们的学习经历却大有不同。有的学习平稳，也有的突然飙升。当然，作为美术生，有背着画包全国考试的，有去了考场不让考的，也有直接不外出考的，最后大家竟然都上了大学，而且上了同一所大学，真是一段奇妙的经历！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你上学期间有哪件事让你记忆犹新？欢迎评论区见哦！也欢迎你来探秘我们的学习故事！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaZPGeM5D6_BSssrItcvPP8gZP8.WEBP"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llLgpsNfUwAyipPsp5fvgLj-HRjE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a></span><strong><span> 学习成绩主打一个俯冲！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 擅长的都是高考不考的😭。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 不会有人没补过课吧。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 我就是英语老师质检员。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 当上班长我就开始抓抄作业的！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 被叫家长真的是噩梦。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 上这么些年学，多少碰见几个事儿b老师。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 好老师我们也是打心眼儿里尊重！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 课堂上还能干这些事？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> 少不了的屎尿屁。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> 学不学先放一边，教辅资料狠狠买起来。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgbmUTcjHjYk46mnKgGJWSLvsn4F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（小甘系列）</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8tF2fhmvZc6ejFjS4xo65LXTbt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（全解也少不了）</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> &nbsp;</span></em><strong><span>画室的经历真的难忘。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFsUtmMCNrWY3h7KzIJJbc4SWBQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（老师在做范画）</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnESkHxtrGCfQOqVNzBuHIm14DVo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>（画睡着了？）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">01:10:47</a> </span><strong><span>每一个艺术生都必经的校考。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4537">01:15:37</a> </span><strong><span>高考真的要狠狠努力。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Staff/ 制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>易玖 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝｜QQ音乐｜微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
