  <item>
    <title>为了博空姐一笑，我居然撒了谎……｜嗨嗨Yi月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e7662dd15a20dbcab761b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e7662dd15a20dbcab761b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第十期节目🎉。</span></p><p><span>《嗨嗨Yi月》是我们的新栏目！每月会更新一期，和大家分享一下这个月当中发生的事情。无论是生活中的小插曲、大事件还是什么意想不到的事等等……我们都会放在《嗨嗨Yi月》中来聊一聊。让我们一起嗨嗨一乐，笑对生活的每一个瞬间！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsALMj0yvfniQIbAKlrxfqSi-j3J.PNG"></figure><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpmVu29Dh0QZInQfy3pvQEdoUB6K.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> </span><strong><span>难得回家，必须见见同学、朋友。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 为博漂亮空姐一笑，我居然撒了谎。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> 缘分很妙，世界很小。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> 家庭有了新成员👪，哄小宝宝不哭的办法居然是深蹲。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 回家路上我泪流满面。</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9_H2ERulEouqQk1wXdsqfFbfPA.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（让九子哥泪流满面的短信）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 什么？九哥要给大家送福利！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> 拉近亲人间关系的方法只需一次长谈。</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsEakAd87n1AtsBNgAFfAOoYH0IP.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（九子哥的卡牌）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">43:11</a> 千里万里，故乡永远是最好的。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a> 滑雪🎿真是太刺激了，明年还得去！</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llQT44pTzyYiDwbk7dLbAQJY2uCu.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（丝绸之路滑雪场的晚霞）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3513">58:33</a> 兰州原来这么好吃！</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv_VhtxNOUWdzhtL8l33S4plVUwl.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（羊肉面片）</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt9nPSSLIzB7b2P2PsoQ_BgAF2Vh.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（哦吼，这包子香疯了哎！）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4068">01:07:48</a> 多年未见再相聚。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">01:09:50</a> 一个假期，崽崽变身烘培带师！ &nbsp;</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmE_nw4u6_savyQwZVihUx0F9hYa.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（崽崽的手艺）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4264">01:11:04</a> 雅思原来这么考。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4419">01:13:39</a> 在兰州的快乐旅程。</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvPJ7R-Cui6RGwBAZkLKCzzSp2_S.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>（傍晚的黄河边）</span></em></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4644">01:17:24</a> 喝酒虽好，可不要贪杯🙅。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5038">01:23:58</a> 跳起舞来唱起歌，幸福真的很简单。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>/Staff/ 制作人</span></strong><span>｜胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>易玖 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><p><strong><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝FM</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>小红书</span></strong><span>：@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><p><strong><span>微博</span></strong><span>：@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvU066WnJG8qc0TWVDLrF4qQ51c5.m4a" length="130189719" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsVklsNEtMOW1PZFlnQjB1bHRQVWVGbU1HQkwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>太吓人了，听到牙科的电钻声我就想逃……｜Vol.09</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65dcd81a0bef6c20745d3431</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65dcd81a0bef6c20745d3431</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Feb 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第九期节目🎉。</span></p><p><span>如果没有一口好牙，我们会失去半边天。牙齿问题覆盖人数非常多，涉及的人群也很广，无论是大人、小孩还是老人，都要认认真真的爱护我们的牙齿。我们三个人全部都被牙疼折磨过，这期就来和大家聊聊我们在牙齿上吃过的苦、踩过得坑！</span></p><p><span>最后祝大家都拥有一口好牙，让你的笑容更加灿烂，让每一次咬合都是一场幸福的盛宴！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLlHr48MjXAH7DghZzKrO0PRvyC.PNG"></figure><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgV8y58tBfziCY2S9vL0s_RIvaD.JPG"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> </span><strong><span>久病成医说的就是我！</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> </span><strong><span>喝了牛奶一定要刷牙。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> </span><strong><span>九哥的智齿疼了两年才去拔。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> </span><strong><span>牙痛到发烧。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> </span><strong><span>听到钻牙声我已经怕了。</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr40lMr5CrYfD7EAc9Sx_WLmwuxg.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> </span><strong><span>根管治疗谁不怕？</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltkk95q8D3hvUtXp_wfC2CzAM19w.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>拔牙可得托着下颌骨。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>矫正牙齿。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> </span><strong><span>不同地区看牙的费用也不同。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> </span><strong><span>牙齿居然还和基因有关。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a></span><strong><span> 口臭是个问题！</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> </span><strong><span>刷牙也有门门道道。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>/Staff/ 制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>易玖 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝FM</span></p><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@胡阿姨JINGYI RADIO</span></p><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
