    <title>奇葩大赏：借我50块，女朋友怀孕了…｜Vol.08</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8df070bef6c2074410a22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d8df070bef6c2074410a22</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Feb 2024 18:08:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第八期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期关于生活中各种“奇葩”人做的“奇葩”事的节目。我们分享着那些让人啼笑皆非的趣事，探讨着那些与众不同的个性。让我们一起笑对奇葩，吐槽一下周遭的不快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgV8y58tBfziCY2S9vL0s_RIvaD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span><strong><span> 给我们对答案的监考老师。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a></span><strong><span> 奇葩教导主任。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a></span><strong><span> 监督我学习的班长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a></span><strong><span> 没收的光碟被老师带回家自己看了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> </span><strong><span>答应叫同学起床，却被骂傻哔……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a></span><strong><span> 别和老师走太近，小心他让你清空购物车。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a></span><strong><span> 满嘴理想信念，遇事唯唯诺诺……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> </span><strong><span>从学长变学弟，狠起来连自己都骗。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> </span><strong><span>借50块，理由是女朋友怀孕了……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> </span><strong><span>从来不洗脚，还要踩我床。又便宜必须占！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> </span><strong><span>千万别绑定美团亲密关系。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> </span><strong><span>电视剧里的刻薄领导都让我给遇上了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> </span><strong><span>说话不拐弯，得了便宜还卖乖！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Staff/</span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜荔枝FM</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
