    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是🎙️JINGYI RADIO的第七期节目🎉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘿，大家好！正值新春佳节，玩的开心吗？在这一期的节目中，我们将探讨如何过一个充满欢乐的节日！从吃喝玩乐到家庭聚会，让我们一起解锁春节的新玩法！别错过，保证让你笑声不断！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝大家新春快乐，阖家幸福，事事顺心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgV8y58tBfziCY2S9vL0s_RIvaD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a></span><strong><span>春节前的大扫除是真的让人头疼。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a></span><strong><span>家家都得提前备年货。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> </span><strong><span>记忆深刻的带鱼。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> </span><strong><span>回新疆过年机票贵的离谱！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a></span><strong><span>异地过年经历。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> </span><strong><span>易家湾的“年”是真的热闹！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a></span><strong><span>春晚最期待什么节目？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a></span><strong><span>孩子真是把炮玩出了花儿。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a></span><strong><span>童年的春节和现在的春节。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a></span><strong><span>什么时候开始自己掌控压岁钱。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a></span><strong><span>抓住春节，狠狠Social！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a></span><strong><span>贺岁片狠狠看起来。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Staff/ 制作人｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 &nbsp;</span><strong><span>文案｜</span></strong><span>胡阿姨 </span><strong><span>封面｜</span></strong><span> 胡阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听JINGYI RADIO，你可以通过以下平台收听我们的播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云｜QQ音乐｜豆瓣｜即刻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong><span>@JINGYI RADIO</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博：</span></strong><span>@这里是景一</span></p>]]></description>
